message: >-
  Cite this work as an anonymous, unrefereed public discussion preprint and
  preserve its identification and assurance boundary.
title: >-
  Stocks Are Not Flows: An Identification Audit of Investor Pressure and
  Tenure Change in England
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Anonymous
abstract: >-
  Reproducible identification audit showing that public English tenure, price,
  rent, supply, and aggregate mortgage-rate series do not uniquely distinguish
  top-resource investor pressure from admitted rival mechanisms. The package
  reports no causal coefficient or historical contribution share.
